@node ambisonics Plugin Parameters
@section Parameters

This plugin has no user-tunable parameters.


@strong{Structural parameters} (Order, Target Layout) require rebuilding the plugin when changed. Other parameters update in real-time with zero dropout.

@node ambisonics Plugin Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

Ambisonics Decoder — AllRAD decoding from Higher-Order Ambisonics to speaker layouts.

@subsubheading What It Does

Decodes Higher-Order Ambisonics (HOA) audio into speaker feeds for any loudspeaker arrangement. Uses the AllRAD (All-Round Ambisonic Decoding) algorithm which combines VBAP panning with Ambisonics theory for robust decoding to irregular speaker layouts.

@subsubheading Features

@itemize @bullet
@item @strong{AllRAD decoding}: Robust decoding for arbitrary speaker layouts
@item @strong{Higher-Order Ambisonics}: Supports multiple Ambisonics orders
@item @strong{Spherical harmonics}: Full SH evaluation for spatial processing
@item @strong{Flexible layouts}: Works with any speaker configuration via VBAP
@end itemize


@subsubheading Architecture

@example
src/
├── lib.rs                  # AmbisonicsDecoderPlugin
├── config.rs               # Decoder configuration
├── decode_matrix.rs        # Decoding matrix computation
├── spherical_harmonics.rs  # SH evaluation
└── params.rs               # Parameters
@end example


@subsubheading Testing

